# Only files inside ./public are published now (see wrangler.jsonc), so this
# list only has to cover junk that can land in there. It is the second line of
# defence, not the first one: the first is that the web root is a directory of
# its own.
.DS_Store

# Sourcemaps and local backups, which have reached the CDN before
*.map
*.onceki
*.bak
*.zip
